[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.92]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.96]I never got their name until the credits
[00:16.00]now it plays here every single day
[00:20.28]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:24.96]One note at a time
[00:29.70]from people passing through
[00:34.70]a name beside a line
[00:39.68]and part of it is you
[00:50.92]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
